00:09:20.426 --> 00:09:29.401
♪♪

00:09:29.401 --> 00:09:30.569
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:30.569 --> 00:09:32.972
I just blew my mind.

00:09:35.307 --> 00:09:37.009
-You just blew your mind?

00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:39.178
-I just blew my mind.
-All right.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:42.514
